import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Affiliate disclosure for Bump Compass — how we earn revenue and what that means for you.">
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

    <h2>How we earn revenue</h2>

    <p>Bump Compass is free to use. We earn revenue through affiliate marketing. When you click certain links on this site and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>

    <h2>What affiliate links look like</h2>

    <p>Affiliate links are marked with a disclosure near the link. For example:</p>

    <div class="affiliate-disclosure">
      <strong>Affiliate link:</strong> If you click this link and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.
    </div>

    <h2>Our affiliate partners</h2>

    <p>We participate in affiliate programs for products and services relevant to pregnancy, babies, and breastfeeding. These include:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Root'd</strong> — prenatal vitamins (17% commission, 45-day cookie)</li>
      <li><strong>Earth Mama</strong> — pregnancy and postpartum skincare (15% commission)</li>
      <li><strong>The Spoiled Mama</strong> — pregnancy skincare (10% commission)</li>
      <li><strong>Motherhood Maternity</strong> — maternity wear (10% commission)</li>
      <li><strong>Momcozy</strong> — baby and breastfeeding products (10-15% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We may add or remove affiliate partners over time. This list will be updated to reflect current partnerships.</p>

    <h2>What this means for you</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>You never pay more.</strong> The price you pay is the same whether you use our link or go directly to the retailer.</li>
      <li><strong>We only recommend products we believe are relevant.</strong> We do not recommend products solely because they pay a commission.</li>
      <li><strong>We do not accept payment for positive reviews.</strong> If we mention a product, it is because it is the subject of the guide — not because we are paid to say so.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>FTC compliance</h2>

    <p>In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines concerning the use of endorsements and testimonials in advertising (16 CFR Part 255), we disclose our material connections to brands and products mentioned on this site.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>

    <p>If you have questions about our affiliate relationships, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
